{"ticker":"NIO","updated":"2026-11-20T23:11:09Z","profile":{"longName":"NIO Inc.","shortName":"NIO Inc.","sector":"Consumer Cyclical","industry":"Auto Manufacturers","country":"China","website":"https://www.nio.com","fullTimeEmployees":35032,"marketCap":6138884608,"trailingPE":null,"forwardPE":19.67388,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":0.053796243,"pegRatio":null,"targetMeanPrice":6.076648,"targetHighPrice":10.146184,"targetLowPrice":3.6977458,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":23,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.691,"earningsGrowth":null,"grossMargins":0.1736,"operatingMargins":-0.03341,"profitMargins":-0.04168,"totalRevenue":114113634304,"beta":0.897,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":7.0,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":2.43,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"NIO Inc. designs, develops, manufactures, and sells smart electric vehicles in China, Europe, and internationally. It offers five and six-seater electric SUVs, as well as smart electric sedans. The company also offers power solutions, including Power Home, a home charging solution; Power Swap, a battery-swapping service; Power Charger and Destination Charger; Power Mobile, a mobile charging service through charging vans; Power Map, an application that provides access to a network of public chargers and their real-time information; and One Click for power valet service. In addition, it provides repair, maintenance, car beauty, and inspection services through its service centers and authorized third-party service centers; vehicle transportation and delivery, pre-delivery inspections, guidance on vehicle features, assistance with vehicle registration, and insurance processing services; insurance, maintenance, repairs, accident rescue, car washing, chauffeur services, and valet parking services; and remote monitoring and real-time diagnostics services, as well as technical, warranty, and auto financing arrangements. Further, the company is involved in the provision of energy and service packages to its users; design and technology development activities; manufacture of electric powertrains, battery packs, and components; and sales and after-sales management activities. Additionally","summary_zh":"蔚來公司在中國、歐洲和國際上設計、開發、製造和銷售智慧電動車。它提供五人座和六人座電動SUV，以及智慧電動轎車。該公司還提供電源解決方案，包括家庭充電解決方案Power Home； Power Swap，電池更換服務；電源充電器和目的地充電器； Power Mobile，透過充電器提供行動充電服務； Power Map，一款可存取公共充電器網路及其即時資訊的應用程式；以及一鍵代客泊車服務。此外，還透過其服務中心及授權的第三方服務中心提供維修、保養、汽車美容、檢測服務；車輛運輸交付、交車前檢驗、車輛特性指導、車輛登記協助、保險辦理服務；保險、保養、維修、事故救援、洗車、代駕服務、代客泊車服務；遠端監控和即時診斷服務，以及技術、保固和汽車融資安排。此外，該公司還向用戶提供能源和服務包；設計和技術開發活動；電動動力總成、電池組和零件的製造；以及銷售和售後管理活動。另外","sector_zh":"週期性消費","industry_zh":"汽車製造商","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-22","o":7.37,"h":7.41,"l":6.8,"c":6.91,"v":128795300},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":6.9,"h":7.17,"l":6.77,"c":6.93,"v":80663300},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":7.08,"h":7.34,"l":6.98,"c":7.12,"v":76711800},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":7.05,"h":7.68,"l":7.0,"c":7.47,"v":92782900},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":7.31,"h":7.37,"l":6.96,"c":7.04,"v":92524000},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":7.13,"h":7.27,"l":6.92,"c":7.21,"v":65361300},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":7.3,"h":7.78,"l":7.3,"c":7.62,"v":107657600},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":7.79,"h":7.9,"l":7.54,"c":7.65,"v":57383700},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":7.85,"h":8.02,"l":7.64,"c":7.89,"v":86946400},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":7.8,"h":7.8,"l":7.5,"c":7.7,"v":68069200},{"t":"2025-10-06","o":7.63,"h":7.85,"l":7.58,"c":7.59,"v":61137200},{"t":"2025-10-07","o":7.57,"h":7.6,"l":7.29,"c":7.5,"v":75295400},{"t":"2025-10-08","o":7.6,"h":7.86,"l":7.57,"c":7.85,"v":75642200},{"t":"2025-10-09","o":7.76,"h":7.8,"l":7.4,"c":7.46,"v":64913000},{"t":"2025-10-10","o":7.44,"h":7.44,"l":6.66,"c":6.71,"v":126261800},{"t":"2025-10-13","o":7.01,"h":7.22,"l":6.96,"c":7.18,"v":65388200},{"t":"2025-10-14","o":6.9,"h":7.0,"l":6.77,"c":6.8,"v":56830400},{"t":"2025-10-15","o":6.99,"h":7.04,"l":6.74,"c":6.82,"v":40112300},{"t":"2025-10-16","o":6.29,"h":6.87,"l":6.28,"c":6.83,"v":125559000},{"t":"2025-10-17","o":6.53,"h":6.77,"l":6.52,"c":6.75,"v":76615100},{"t"